		(property "Description" "3-way JST PH (2.0mm) CAN-FD bus connector. Deliberately 3-way, not 4-way: the RS-485 daisy-chain connectors are JST_PH-4_HOLE and carry +7V, so a 4-way CAN port would be cross-mateable with them and would drive +7V onto the isolated CAN bus. Pinout P$1=CAN_GND (bus-side isolated ground), P$2=CANL, P$3=CANH -- CANH/CANL kept adjacent for twisted-pair continuity. Symbol-only: footprint pending, and is a trivial one-position derivative of the existing JST_PH-4_HOLE_B land pattern. See PCB/MSPM0G3507-MCU-swap.md."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(effects
